description "Clone Assassin

Dexterous troopers with specialty skills focused on covert elimination and head-on combat.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 12% faster RoF
- Assassin's Vibroshivs (Dual Saber)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- Poisons on hit
-- 75% more special damage
-- 20% more knockback
-- 35% shorter
-- 400% thicker

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Getup (2)
- 7% less knockback taken
- 85% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Dash (2) ^3[CS3]"